@page "/container"

<PageTitle>Container - GDS Components Demo</PageTitle>

<GdsBackLink Href="/" />

<GdsHeading Level="1">Container</GdsHeading>

<p class="govuk-body">
    The container layout component allows the users to easily wrap content in a container that applies the GOV.UK width and padding, ensuring consistent spacing and alignment across the service.
</p>

<GdsHeading Level="2">Example</GdsHeading>
<div style="border: 1px solid black; padding: 10px;">
    <GdsContainer>
        <div>Container example</div>
    </GdsContainer>
</div>

<p class="govuk-body govuk-!-margin-top-6">
    <strong>Note:</strong> The container in this demo page is shown within a border for demonstration purposes. 
</p>
